                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Alexander Boyko &amp;lt;c17825@cray.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/74f02da1-8ade-46d9-bd71-7288c099ff64" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/74f02da1-8ade-46d9-bd71-7288c099ff64&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_170 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;import is not in FULL state
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/126583" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/126583&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-611.55.1.el9_7.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/126583" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/126583&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-611.55.1_lustre.el9.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The test is a new one and was introduced with&lt;br/&gt;
f0d3dbe8e1 &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18154" title="Client can permanently hang in lustre recovery on race condition in replay_locks " class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18154"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18154&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ptlrpc: don't delay rq_no_delay after IDLE&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Looks it fails sometimes. Need more logs. The current log time frame is too late for rc.&lt;/p&gt;






